WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
Before dawn, a Muslim stands to pray.

2
00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.040
She recites seven short verses.

3
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:11.950
By night, after five daily prayers, she
will have said them around 17 times.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.850
These verses are al-Fatiha, The
Opening, the first surah of the Qur'an.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.490
Some call it the Mother of the Book.

6
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:24.170
So what do these seven short
verses say about Allah?

7
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:29.280
In this mission, you'll read al-Fatiha,
then see how Surah 6 teaches tawhid,

8
00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.710
the oneness of Allah.

9
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.430
Then you'll meet six of
the 99 beautiful names,

10
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.860
and how Muslims use them in prayer.

11
00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.840
Your mission: find out what these
seven verses teach Muslims about Allah.
